  message: "SATISFIED FOR THE FILED INSTANCE in PR #1340 (merged, dev 7664a18861). The general statement is NOT asserted: residual WI-midit-kalat-haniz-zimuk-vaniz-tibam-lajaj-rufaz (an alias use carries no carrier; cpp << is not wired).\n\nBEHAVIOURAL EVIDENCE, re-run on merged dev 7664a18861 (host_secret -> logging):\n  python print(k, file=sys.stderr):            ONE row [builtins.print] -- was two rows ([sys.stderr] precise-DDG + [builtins.print]) and \"2 unsanitized flows\"; now \"1 unsanitized\"\n  python json.dump(k, sys.stdout):             [sys.stdout] sink_carriers [json.dump@8] -- the stream kept, its call named\n  python print(..file=sys.stderr) + json.dump(k, sys.stderr): [builtins.print] + [sys.stderr] carriers [json.dump@9, print@8] -- kept (one carrier is not a sink)\n  go io.WriteString(os.Stderr, k):              ONE row [io.WriteString]\n  go log.SetOutput(os.Stderr):                  [os.Stderr] carriers [log.SetOutput@10] -- the false positive is now visible as configuration\n  java System.out.println(k):                   [java.lang.System.out] carriers [System.out.println@4] -- receiver named\n  javascript process.stdout.write(k):           [process.stdout] carriers [process.stdout.write@3]\nMechanism: analyzers stamp attr_carrier (\"<callee>@<line>\") on module_attr_ref edges (py.py; go/java/javascript via base.emit_module_attribute_refs); taint drops an attribute sink site only when every use is carried by a matched non-attribute sink at the same caller/line/zone; surviving stream findings carry sink_carriers; verify-claims schema 2.6.\nA/B pre-registered (~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/hopib_09302026/RESULT.md, 12 repos x 7 claims): no verdict moved; io-boundaries identical; rows 522 -> 517; 74 stream pairs removed, each with its call still reported per source primitive; 101 rows name carriers. Two refutations as written (collapsed-tuple atom key; the 100-row evidence cap), both diagnosed as instrument artifacts, re-checked clean per source primitive."  # 8df8
